#: src/Application/Health/HealthService.php:214
msgid "Page cache"
msgstr "Кэш страниц"

#: src/Application/Health/HealthService.php:216
msgid "No page cache without an integration was detected."
msgstr "Кэш страниц без поддерживаемой интеграции не обнаружен."

#: src/Application/Health/HealthService.php:217
msgid "A page cache without a known integration is active. After a restore, clear the page cache manually if visitors still see the old version."
